<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_layoutMng" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.3.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="layoutMng" name="전문 레이아웃" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>layoutMng — 전문 레이아웃 (To-Be only 신규 화면).
정본: docs/mdm/screens/layoutMng/layoutMng_기능설계서.md, docs/mdm/tasks/TSK-05-02/design.md §6.1

action=search|view|save|validate|execute|export|copy|delete|lock|unlock|handover -&gt; {action}Task (layoutMngService.{action}). 내용 쓰기는 save 만.
버전 조작 copy(새 버전 MAJOR·MINOR)·delete(target VERSION = DRAFT 삭제, CONFIRM = 확정 취소)·lock·unlock·handover 는 공통 버전 서비스로만 한다(LayoutVersionService, DTO LayoutVersionRequest).
저장은 내 DRAFT 에만 쓴다. 버전은 copy(새 버전)·확정(layoutConfirm)으로 바뀐다(D-144). 조회·검증·샘플·내보내기는 시각 T(asOf, 비면 지금)의 헤더 버전으로 합성한다.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start" name="시작">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway" name="action 분기">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_view</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_validate</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_execute</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_copy</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_delete</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lock</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_unlock</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_handover</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="전문 목록 조회" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>target=LAYOUT(기본) 전문 목록·시스템·EAI·헤더 / HEADER 헤더 선택 / COLUMN 컬럼 사전 검색(D8).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_search" name="전문 목록 조회 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="viewTask" name="전문 상세" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>고른 버전(ver, 없으면 내 DRAFT → 남의 DRAFT → 지금 적용 중)의 기본 속성·헤더 구성(시각 T 의 헤더 버전 항목·재정의·실효값)·본문 항목·버전 이력. 응답 result.layout·selected·editable·asOf·headers·items·units·versions.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="view" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngViewRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_view</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_view_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_view" name="전문 상세 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_view_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="saveTask" name="전문 저장" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>검사 L01~L11 → 내 DRAFT 의 버전 행·헤더 적층·상수 재정의·본문 항목(본문 기준 상대 오프셋 서버 계산). 등록이면 1.000 DRAFT, 수정이면 ver·rowVersion 필수. grid headers·consts·items — 헤더 항목 입력 없음(I8).</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="save" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngSaveRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_save" name="전문 저장 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="end_search" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_view" name="view" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="viewTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_view_end" sourceRef="viewTask" targetRef="end_view" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save" name="save" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="saveTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save_end" sourceRef="saveTask" targetRef="end_save" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="validateTask" name="등록 검증" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>03 등록 거부 7종 표(L01·L12·L13·L14·L02 FILLER_LENGTH·L05·L15, TSK-05-03 §6.2). grid headers·consts·items. 쓰기 없음.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="validate" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngSaveRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_validate</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_validate_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_validate" name="등록 검증 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_validate_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="executeTask" name="샘플 전문 렌더" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>예시 값 → 인코딩 바이트 기준 한 줄(서버 직렬화기, TSK-05-03 D13). grid headers·consts·items·samples. 쓰기 없음.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="execute" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngExecuteRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_execute</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_execute_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_execute" name="샘플 전문 렌더 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_execute_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="exportTask" name="스냅샷 출력" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>시각 T(asOf) 의 합성 스냅샷 JSON(TSK-05-03 §6.1, D-144). ver 생략 시 T 에 적용 중인 버전. 쓰기 없음.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="export" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutMngExportRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_export" name="스냅샷 출력 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_validate" name="validate" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="validateTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_validate_end" sourceRef="validateTask" targetRef="end_validate" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_execute" name="execute" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="executeTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_execute_end" sourceRef="executeTask" targetRef="end_execute" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export" name="export" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="exportTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export_end" sourceRef="exportTask" targetRef="end_export" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="copyTask" name="새 버전" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>새 버전(verKind MAJOR·MINOR, 비면 MAJOR) — 직전 RELEASED 의 항목·헤더 구성·재정의를 복사한 DRAFT(소유자 = 나). 미적용·승인 흐름 버전이 있으면 MDM006. 응답 result = LayoutVersionResult{layoutId, ver, verKind, rowVersion}.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="copy" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutVersionRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_copy</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_copy_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_copy" name="새 버전 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_copy_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_copy" name="copy" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="copyTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_copy_end" sourceRef="copyTask" targetRef="end_copy" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="deleteTask" name="버전 삭제" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>target VERSION(기본) = DRAFT 삭제(소유자만, 그 버전 행만 지운다 — LayoutDraftDeletion), CONFIRM = 확정 취소(적용 전 RELEASED → DRAFT, ADR-0002 D8). 응답 result = LayoutVersionResult.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="delete" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutVersionRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_delete</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_delete_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_delete" name="버전 삭제 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_delete_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_delete" name="delete" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="deleteTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_delete_end" sourceRef="deleteTask" targetRef="end_delete" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="lockTask" name="DRAFT 선점" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>빈 소유자 DRAFT 선점(담당자만, MDM013·MDM004). 응답 result.rowVersion = 새 row_version.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="lock" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutVersionRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lock</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lock_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_lock" name="DRAFT 선점 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lock_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lock" name="lock" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="lockTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lock_end" sourceRef="lockTask" targetRef="end_lock" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="unlockTask" name="DRAFT 해제" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>DRAFT 해제(소유자만, MDM003). 응답 result.rowVersion = 새 row_version.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="unlock" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutVersionRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_unlock</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_unlock_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_unlock" name="DRAFT 해제 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_unlock_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_unlock" name="unlock" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="unlockTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_unlock_end" sourceRef="unlockTask" targetRef="end_unlock" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="handoverTask" name="DRAFT 넘기기" camunda:class="layoutMngService">
      <bpmn:documentation>DRAFT 넘기기(소유자만, 받는 사람 newOwnerId 는 담당자 — MDM005). 응답 result.rowVersion = 새 row_version.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="handover" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmb.layoutMng.dto.LayoutVersionRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_handover</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_handover_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="end_handover" name="DRAFT 넘기기 완료">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_handover_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_handover" name="handover" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="handoverTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_handover_end" sourceRef="handoverTask" targetRef="end_handover" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_1">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="BPMNPlane_1" bpmnElement="layoutMng">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="start_di" bpmnElement="start">
        <dc:Bounds x="152" y="282" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="actionGateway_di" bpmnElement="actionGateway" isMarkerVisible="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="245" y="275" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="searchTask_di" bpmnElement="searchTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="100" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_search_di" bpmnElement="end_search">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="122" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="viewTask_di" bpmnElement="viewTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="260" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_view_di" bpmnElement="end_view">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="282" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="saveTask_di" bpmnElement="saveTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="420" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_save_di" bpmnElement="end_save">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="442" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_to_gw_di" bpmnElement="flow_to_gw">
        <di:waypoint x="188" y="300" />
        <di:waypoint x="245" y="300" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_di" bpmnElement="flow_search">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="275" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="140" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="140" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="305" y="123" width="48" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_search_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_search_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="140" />
        <di:waypoint x="562" y="140" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_view_di" bpmnElement="flow_view">
        <di:waypoint x="295" y="300" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="300" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="317.5" y="283" width="32" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_view_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_view_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="300" />
        <di:waypoint x="562" y="300" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_save_di" bpmnElement="flow_save">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="325" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="460" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="305" y="308" width="32" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_save_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_save_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="562" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="validateTask_di" bpmnElement="validateTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="580" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_validate_di" bpmnElement="end_validate">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="602" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="executeTask_di" bpmnElement="executeTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="740" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_execute_di" bpmnElement="end_execute">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="762" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="exportTask_di" bpmnElement="exportTask">
        <dc:Bounds x="380" y="900" width="100" height="80" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="end_export_di" bpmnElement="end_export">
        <dc:Bounds x="562" y="922" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_validate_di" bpmnElement="flow_validate">
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="325" />
        <di:waypoint x="270" y="620" />
        <di:waypoint x="380" y="620" />
        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
          <dc:Bounds x="305" y="308" width="64" height="14" />
        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="flow_validate_end_di" bpmnElement="flow_validate_end">
        <di:waypoint x="480" y="620" />
        <di:waypoint x="562" y="620" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
